
Template: natsume-client/server-ip
Type: string
Description: Natsume Server IP address:
 Enter the canonical IPv4 or IPv6 literal used by this workstation to reach the Natsume Server.
 The Server TLS certificate must contain this address as an IP subjectAltName.

Template: natsume-client/server-port
Type: string
Default: 8443
Description: Natsume Server port:
 The same numeric port is used for HTTPS over TCP and Device QUIC over UDP.
